# Candid material never belongs in a public repo. This repo is public.
# Captain's Log reflections are verbatim and personal; keep them here on disk,
# out of git. See ~/Projects/captains-log/PROMPT.md.
REFLECTIONS.md

# Reasoning never ships. This repo is public, so the only markdown in it is
# markdown a stranger is meant to read: the README, the agent notes, and the
# site's own content under src/content/. Everything else (positioning
# arguments, pricing and cannibalisation analysis, SEO logs, competitor
# benchmarks, copy drafts, anything worked out in conversation) lives in the
# vault at 06-Resources/Intentionaut/Site_Docs/, which has no remote.
# Enforced by .githooks/pre-commit, not by anyone remembering.
docs/
/*.md
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
# intracor: contains the API key inline (mode 600)
.mcp.json
# intracor: local per-commit extraction cache (regenerated; never commit),
# but keep observability.yaml versioned (the service-to-repo map)
.intracor/*
!.intracor/observability.yaml
